From df7477244a278d1bd91fe554296e8fc14da85f6b Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Codex <codex@openai.com>
Date: Tue, 3 Nov 2026 01:07:30 +0800
Subject: [PATCH 08/10] Verify measured sealed volumes and native initdata
 binding

Retain fail-closed sealed volume verification before the guest agent.
Use the existing process-user-data binary to bind exact initdata with the
released native AA ttrpc API, enforcing one canonical SHA384 TCG2 event
and rejecting disabled measurement, digest mismatch or duplicate events.

Reject injected cloud volumes in the measured confidential ephemeral profile before device preparation.

